=== task: multi medium
title: Wide and deep
prompt: Choose **every** true statement about n-ary trees with n nodes.
* A star, a root with n − 1 children, has height 1 :: Right. Every leaf is one edge from the root.
* A chain, where each node has one child, has height n − 1 :: Right. It's a line.
* `count` is O(n) whatever the shape :: Right. It visits each node once and follows each edge once.
